              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Bibi"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I really loved this salad dressing. I loved the lemony flavor and the fresh herbs. If I tweaked the dressing at all, it was to add more dill and basil, to my taste. My veggies included: baby cukes, grape tomatoes, a yellow bell pepper, scallions and Romaine. The dressing complemented everything, but especially the tomatoes! Thanks for posting!",
